   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Kodachrome rich: median ~80, crushed blacks (p1 ~2), warm brown shadows (31,24,20), restrained warm highlights (p99 ~209), reds+oranges 51% with a strong aqua bin (18%), the second most saturated look (0.48). Best for: Warm evening streets, colour-blocked walls, beaches and pools, heritage towns (Jaipur, Jodhpur), sun-washed scenes. Film-like density.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
